                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded mt-3" style="background:#f8f9fa;border-left:4px solid #1a3c6b;">
                  <h4 style="color:#1a3c6b;">Mission</h4>
                  <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li>To provide high quality education and make the students as ethical, world class professionals.</li>
                    <li>To improve the skills of both staff and students with opportunities to innovate and explore knowledge through research projects and consultancy.</li>
