            <div class="row">
              <div class="col-lg-8">
                <h3>About the Department</h3>
                <p>The Department of Civil Engineering at SRKR Engineering College was established in 1980 and has grown into one of the leading centres for civil engineering education and applied research in Andhra Pradesh, especially in the coastal region. The department offers both B.Tech. in Civil Engineering and M.Tech. in Structural Engineering programs. Its undergraduate program has been accredited four times by the National Board of Accreditation for the periods 2002–2007, 2007–2012, 2020–2023, and 2023–2026, reflecting its sustained commitment to quality technical education. The department has consistently produced graduates with strong technical expertise, communication abilities, and professional values.</p>
                <p>The department adopts innovative teaching practices to enhance student learning. These include classroom teaching, seminars, presentations, video lectures, MOOC platforms, honours/minor programs, experiential learning, and online sessions by internal and external experts. Students are trained in modern industry-relevant software such as STAAD.Pro/REVIT and other structural design tools through specialized workshops. Full-semester internships at reputed organizations across India further help students gain practical exposure and strengthen employability.</p>
                <p>The department is also a major contributor to consultancy services in Structural, Geotechnical, Transportation, and Environmental Engineering, generating over 80% of the institution's consultancy revenue. It actively promotes research through six Centres of Excellence focused on water quality, advanced materials, and environmental sustainability. Recognized as a research centre by Andhra University and Jawaharlal Nehru Technological University Kakinada, the department continues to nurture innovation, publications, and socially responsible future engineers.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="card shadow-sm">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title" style="color:#1a3c6b;">Quick Facts</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                      <li><strong>Established:</strong> 1980</li>
