            <h3>Facilities</h3>
            <p>The Civil Engineering Department at SRKR Engineering College is equipped with eleven well-maintained laboratories featuring the latest machines, instruments, and software to support both B.Tech and M.Tech courses in Civil Engineering. These facilities also provide consultancy services to various industries and government agencies. Students are provided extensive training to use these resources effectively, ensuring they gain hands-on experience with cutting-edge technology.</p>
            <p>The department also houses a digital learning center equipped with i3/i5 computers, connected over a campus-wide LAN with high-speed internet access.</p>

